  "title": "Envela Reports First Quarter 2026 Financial Results",
  "summary": "IRVING, TX / ACCESS Newswire / May 6, 2026 / Envela Corporation today announced its financial results for its first quarter ended March 31, 2026. The Company reported quarterly revenue of $98.4 million and quarterly earnings per diluted share of $0.34. Management Commentary “We are pleased to report our results for the first fiscal quarter […]",
